18:T517,Hiring SEO Expert

Job description
Key Responsibilities:
Manage all company social media accounts (Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, YouTube, TikTok, etc.)
Handle content uploading, scheduling, and cross-posting across platforms
Plan, execute, and manage social media ad campaigns (Facebook Ads, Google Ads, etc.)
Implement SEO strategies to increase online visibility and search rankings
Monitor campaign performance and provide regular reports with insights
Collaborate with the design & content team to create engaging posts and ad creatives
Stay updated with the latest digital marketing trends and tools for growth

 Requirements:
Minimum 2+ years of experience in SEO, social media management, and ad campaign handling
Strong knowledge of Google Ads, Facebook Ads Manager, and other ad platforms
Proficiency in keyword research, analytics, and performance optimization
Excellent communication and creative thinking skills
Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously

What We Offer:
Competitive salary (based on experience)
Growth & learning opportunities
A creative and collaborative work environment

Apply Now:
Send your CV/Resume to:
 Email: info@albatrosscreatives.com

NOTE: This role is based exclusively in our Islamabad office and requires on-site presence.19:T445,*👤 We're Hiring – HR Executive (Payroll)* 
📍 *Location:* Mouch Goth, (Hub) or SITE Area, Karachi 
🏢 *Company:* M.Y. Bari Mills Pvt. Ltd. 
💼 *Industry:* Textile Manufacturing 
🕒 *Employment Type:* Full-Time 

We are looking for an experienced *HR Executive* with expertise in *Payroll, Shift Roster Management, ATS (Applicant Tracking System), and TMS (Time Management System).*

*Requirements:* 
- Bachelor’s/Master’s in HR or related field 
- 2–3 years of relevant experience in Payroll & HR systems 
- Familiar with *FlowHCM* or any similar HRMS 
- Strong understanding of *attendance, leave & shift rosters* 
- Good analytical and coordination skills 
- Proficient in *MS Excel* and reporting tools 

*Responsibilities:* 
- Handle *monthly payroll processing* 
- Maintain *shift rosters and attendance records* 
- Operate *ATS* for recruitment tracking 
- Monitor and resolve issues in *TMS* 
- Collaborate with departments for HR operations 

📧 *Apply Now:* 
Send your resume to tauseef.ahmed@barimills.com.pk
